  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_wings_1.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Bad Eden Heritage (v1.1, RFI-native).</strong> Sephirotic Scion heritage: Seraphic.</p><p><em>“What the Seraphim did to the wicked was sing them clean. Try not to be wicked around one.”</em></p><p><strong>Sephirotic Scion (Seraphic).</strong> Your blood runs burning. The Seraphim are six-winged fire — the order closest to the throne, the order whose job is purification. You don’t run hot in the Igneous Menhirkin sense; you run hot in the moral sense. Things around you either align or combust. There is not a middle option.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Sephirotic Scion).</p></li><li><p><strong>Size.</strong> Medium.</p></li><li><p><strong>Movement.</strong> 6 squares walking.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lineage Lean.</strong> Sephirotic Scion does not grant fixed attribute bonuses; your background handles increases. Your heritage leans toward <strong>Presence</strong> in fiction and through Tier powers.</p></li></ul><h3>Sephirotic Scion Core: The Higher Register</h3><p><em>Shared across all Sephirotic Scion heritages. Granted at character creation via the base ancestry item.</em></p><ul><li><p><strong>Sephirotic Physiology.</strong> You have resistance to sephirotic damage. Your blood runs a little bright under the right light; you do not technically age while on consecrated ground.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sefirot Attunement.</strong> At creation, pick one sephirah (player choice). Once per scene, you can invoke its register and gain a +1 rank bonus to one check that falls clearly within that sephirah's domain.</p></li><li><p><strong>Holy Conduit.</strong> Manifestations, rituals, and other sephirotic-register effects that target you or pass through your space treat their effective caster-attribute as +1 for the duration of that effect. Works on allies and on you; does not work on qliphothic-register effects.</p></li><li><p><strong>Light of Harmony.</strong> When two or more creatures within 6 squares of you are in active, explicit agreement (stated aloud), they each gain 1 temporary Integrity. This refreshes when a new agreement is reached between different creatures.</p></li></ul><h3>Seraphic Traits</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Coal-Song.</strong> You know a minor manifestation that produces a single point of sephirotic damage at close range (flavor: holy fire). Your channel for it is Presence.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unburning.</strong> You have resistance to sephirotic damage with the fire flavor, and to sephirotic damage. What you are is not flammable to itself.</p></li></ul><h3>Strategic Hooks (Foundry / Bad Eden)</h3><ul><li><p><strong>OP Edge.</strong> Your faction gains <strong>+2 Faith OP</strong> and <strong>+1 Violence OP</strong> at campaign start.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hex Synergy.</strong> In <em>Consecrated / Pyre-Marked / Witnessed</em> hexes, your faction's cleansing, judgment, and pyre operations cost 1 fewer OP.</p></li><li><p><strong>Burning Witness.</strong> Once per Strategic Turn, when your faction confronts a rival faction in open negotiation, the rival must commit to one truth they would have preferred to conceal. The flame is close to the throne; lying hurts.</p></li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #6a8caa;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(55,75,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #a8c4e0; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Sefirot Attunement</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/scene  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Free (declare before roll)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Invoke your chosen sephirah for +1 rank bonus on a check clearly in its domain.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
